  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n### Added <!-- for new features. -->\n\n### Changed <!--  for changes in existing functionality. -->\n\n### Deprecated <!--  for soon-to-be removed features. -->\n\n### Removed <!-- for now removed features. -->\n\n### Fixed <!-- for any bug fixes. -->\n\n### Security <!-- in case of vulnerabilities. -->\n\n## 0.1.0-alpha3\n\n### Added\n\n- External references: `CreateMessageRequest.ExternalReferences` (`ExternalReferenceRequest` with the\n  string enum `ExternalReferenceType`), `CreateMessageRequestFactory.WithExternalReference` and\n  client-side validation in `ExternalReferenceRules` (at most 10, values 1–1000 characters). Mapped to\n  Altinn's correspondence external references.\n- Attachment display names: optional `MessageAttachment.DisplayName`, sent as `attachmentMetadata` in\n  the multipart payload (matched by order) and shown in Altinn instead of the file name.\n  `AttachmentRules.MaxDisplayNameLength` (255).\n- The stub resolves `GetMessageStatusAsync` and `GetCorrespondenceDetailsAsync` by message ID or by\n  idempotent key. The API is expected to support lookup by idempotent key in a later release.\n\n## 0.1.0-alpha2\n\n### Added\n\n- Kiota-generated `KommunikasjonApiClient` for the Kommunikasjon `/api` surface.\n- `IKommunikasjonAdapter`: send messages (JSON or multipart with PDF attachments), read status and\n  correspondence details, manage subscriptions.\n- `AddKommunikasjonClient`: base URL derived from the host environment and\n  `KommunikasjonEnvironment` (`Production`, `Dev`, `Local`, `Stub`), standard resilience (retries\n  `POST /api/meldinger` thanks to the idempotent key) and a `Kommunikasjon` health check.\n- `Stub` environment with an in-memory adapter returning dummy data.",
